  "narrative": "Starting from the late-2025 anchor near 7.0 million English Wikipedia articles, reaching 7,145,000 by March 1, 2026 would demand a near-term surge well beyond observed growth. While small upside is possible from AI-enabled content growth or partnerships, the balance of evidence points to a very low probability of hitting the threshold.",
